  English (values/) and Kinyarwanda (values-rw/), matching Rwanda's own three official
  languages. Added by a full en/rw parity check (100% rw coverage confirmed same
  session) that also surfaced there was no values-fr/ directory at all. Every string
  here mirrors values/strings.xml exactly, key for key; see that file's own header
  comment for the real screen-by-screen rollout history this localization work follows.
-->
